# Third-Party Notices

Aegis AI reimplements ideas and patterns from the following open-source
projects.  Where code was adapted, the source licence is permissive (MIT or
Apache-2.0) and attribution is given below.  No GPL or unlicensed code was
copied; all adaptations were reimplemented in the Aegis AI (FastAPI/Python)
architecture and ship behind opt-in feature flags.

---

## sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform
- **Repository:** https://github.com/sujankim/jarvis-ai-platform
- **Licence:** Apache License 2.0
- **Adapted ideas:** long-term vector memory of events/preferences with owner
  view/delete; per-camera time-of-day baseline with deviation alerts; provider
  abstraction (local Ollama + cloud fallback); `doctor` / `benchmark-latency`
  startup health probes; MCP tool runtime; ReACT agent-style multi-step tool
  execution.
- **Aegis AI files:** `ownerai/services/baseline.py`, `ownerai/services/doctor.py`,
  `ownerai/services/mcp.py`, `ownerai/routers/baseline.py`,
  `ownerai/routers/doctor.py`, `ownerai/routers/mcp.py`

